  <link rel="preload" href="/css/main.css?v=1237" as="style">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css?v=1237">
  <style>
    .home-page { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
    .home-hero { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.25rem; margin: 3rem 0 2.5rem; }
    .home-hero img { width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
    .home-hero h1 { margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .home-hero p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-secondary-text, #666); }
    .home-block { margin: 0 0 2.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .home-block h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
    .home-block p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    .home-link { font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
    .home-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .home-social { margin: 2.5rem 0 3rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="home-page">
    <header class="home-hero">
      <img src="/images/me.jpeg" alt="Sasha Bondar">
      <div>
        <h1>Sasha Bondar</h1>
        <p>Engineer and entrepreneur.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="home-block">
      <h2>I'm writing a book</h2>
      <p><em>Requisite Variety</em> — a systems method for working with AI. Not prompt collections: a way to see your work with a model as a system and stay the one who steers. Written in the open; finished chapters go up as they're ready.</p>
      <p><a class="home-link" href="/variety">About the book and chapters →</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="home-block">
      <h2>I run Reintech</h2>
      <p><a href="https://reintech.io">Reintech</a> is a hiring marketplace for senior software engineers: candidates are vetted on how they actually think — an adversarial AI interview over their real work, then a human one — and companies hire from two-three finalists in days, with legal and payroll handled.</p>
      <p><a class="home-link" href="https://reintech.io">reintech.io →</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="home-social">
      <a class="home-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/obondar/">LinkedIn →</a>
    </section>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
